EVALUATE
// Who the model takes the viewer to be. On the Copilot Managed Runtime each viewer
// queries through their own Power BI connection, so this should show them,
// and row-level security filters for them. The object ID lets Copy results say
// whether the model sees the signed-in viewer without copying either sign-in.
ROW("UPN", USERPRINCIPALNAME(), "User", USERNAME(), "ObjectId", USEROBJECTID())
